{"resourceIdentifier":"4950","resourceName":"Berglandmilch Cooperative Grouped Project: Reduction of methane emissions in the Austrian Dairy Sector","description":"Berglandmilch Cooperative Grouped Project for the reduction of methane emissions in the Austrian Dairy Sector ('project') introduces nature-based feed additives in dairy production to reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions. The objective of the project is to significantly reduce methane (CH4) emissions produced as a by-product of microbial activity during enteric fermentation processes in ruminants. Agolin® Ruminant and Agolin® Naturu (organic product) (herein together referred to as 'Agolin'®) are the two functional, nature-based feed additives implemented in this project. Agolin® has a direct effect on the microbial population and its activity in rumen, which alters fermentation processes and ultimately reduces methane emissions","location":{"latitude":48.124442,"longitude":14.758055},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-03-22","endExclusive":"2024-04-22","endInclusive":"2024-04-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4950"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Various"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Berglandmilch eGen"},{"type":"string","value":"Aschbach-Markt, Austria"},{"type":"string","value":"+43 (7476) 77311-5125"},{"type":"string","value":"georg.lehner@berglandmilch.at"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4950"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24369"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0041"}]},{"code":"VALID